WEBVTT

00:00.975 --> 00:04.237
In Uzbekistan, every school day is built

00:04.237 --> 00:06.438
from forty-five-minute lessons.

00:07.676 --> 00:09.890
But not every minute is teaching.

00:10.027 --> 00:12.076
Uzbek teachers report that more than a

00:12.076 --> 00:14.802
quarter of lesson time goes to admin and

00:14.802 --> 00:15.789
keeping order.

00:17.016 --> 00:19.829
The rest is one explanation, for up to

00:19.829 --> 00:22.091
thirty-five students, each learning at

00:22.091 --> 00:23.165
a different speed.

00:24.264 --> 00:26.777
In the latest published PISA maths results,

00:26.914 --> 00:29.651
only one in five fifteen-year-olds reached

00:29.651 --> 00:31.039
basic proficiency.

00:31.176 --> 00:34.251
Across the OECD, it is more than two in

00:34.251 --> 00:35.051
three.

00:36.344 --> 00:39.107
And teachers often discover what was not

00:39.107 --> 00:41.257
understood weeks later, at the test.

00:44.132 --> 00:46.719
Smart Schools closes that gap, inside

00:46.719 --> 00:48.069
the lesson itself.

00:49.559 --> 00:52.547
Minute one: a camera counts how many students

00:52.547 --> 00:54.760
are present, and the teacher confirms

00:54.760 --> 00:56.185
the roster with a tap.

00:56.334 --> 00:58.021
No faces identified.

00:59.136 --> 01:01.636
Then the teacher teaches, with approved,

01:01.636 --> 01:04.137
curriculum-aligned visual explanations,

01:04.236 --> 01:05.961
in Uzbek or Russian.

01:07.124 --> 01:09.499
In the final minutes, a short quiz shows

01:09.499 --> 01:12.936
exactly which idea did not land, so tomorrow’s

01:12.936 --> 01:14.436
lesson starts right there.

01:15.648 --> 01:18.036
At home, homework adapts to age.

01:18.198 --> 01:21.035
Playful missions and hints, not answers,

01:21.035 --> 01:22.348
for younger students.

01:22.498 --> 01:25.098
Visual, step-by-step reasoning for older

01:25.098 --> 01:25.798
ones.

01:27.092 --> 01:29.417
And guided AI tutoring works.

01:29.542 --> 01:31.917
In a World Bank study, six weeks of AI

01:31.917 --> 01:34.880
tutoring produced gains equal to one and

01:34.880 --> 01:37.517
a half to two years of typical schooling.

01:39.248 --> 01:40.236
Smart Schools.

01:40.398 --> 01:41.636
The teacher leads.

01:41.785 --> 01:42.697
AI helps.

01:42.861 --> 01:44.336
Every lesson, understood.
